                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration KSV110**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Kubernetes Security Check|LOW|Workloads in the default namespace|deployment app in default namespace should set metadata.namespace to a non-default namespace|[KSV110](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv110)|\n\nChecks whether a workload is running in the default namespace."
              },
